COMMENT ON VIEW GN_DW.GOLD.WIDE_TARGET_DEV IS '회원개발 목표 평탄화 (FTG_D × ORG[as-was]). 월 grain=MONTH_KEY.'
[0m21:05:46.433436 [debug] [Thread-2 (]: SQL status: SUCCESS 1 in 1.686 seconds
[0m21:05:46.434296 [debug] [Thread-3 (]: SQL status: SUCCESS 1 in 0.139 seconds
